Description: Deepin dynamic video wallpaper plugin
 Desktop-edge plugin for dde-file-manager with FFmpeg video decoding,
 control center UI with video upload and format conversion.
 .
 This package contains:
  * Desktop-edge plugin (FFmpeg decoder, embedded rendering)
  * Control center plugin (wallpaper list, upload, format conversion)

Package: deepin-meme-plugin-data
Section: misc
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Data files for deepin-meme-plugin (videos, dconfig schema)
 This package contains architecture-independent data files:
  * Preset video wallpapers (H264 MP4)
  * DConfig schema (org.deepin.meme)
